{"3674940": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Do Crimes!", "steam_appid": 3674940, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><u>Since you somehow snuck in here early… here’s more about the game:</u></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3674940/extras/93fd7608d29f2eabe2f7afd48a0f6201.avif?t=1777406085\" width=616 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do Crimes is a <strong>WALLRIDE-Certified Chaos Playground</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You and up to 3 friends <strong>GO ON A RUN</strong> of crash-landing into Shopping Malls, <strong>SMASHING &amp; GRABBING LOOT</strong>, Avoiding Security, and trying not to get <strong>KILLED</strong> by Gnarly Law Enforcement. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steal everything… <strong>Try to Escape</strong>… then hit the next, more-difficult Mall - until you’re all <strong>eventually turned into brain-mush</strong>.<br>Use your <strong>Shared Cash Earnings</strong> to buy Gadgets and Upgrades between Rounds. <strong>Individual Performances</strong> award Vouchers to purchase permanent cosmetics - <strong>so play nice, or don’t!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3674940/extras/a3410d10741373bb05077c9af028c855.poster.avif?t=1777406085\" width=616 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3674940/extras/a3410d10741373bb05077c9af028c855.webm?t=1777406085\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3674940/extras/a3410d10741373bb05077c9af028c855.mp4?t=1777406085\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drop into shopping Malls, Smash ans Steal everything, complete Merle's Objectives, rack up Crime points, and make it to the Escape Truck before you're overrun by law enforcement protecting the <i>Bazillionaire's stupid malls.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3674940/extras/9ab08ee67e7af3be8c04a3623fda180a.avif?t=1777406085\" width=616 height=70 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiplayer extraction mayhem</strong> with your Friends!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mall layouts, attributes and hazards <strong>randomize</strong> each jump</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Give everyone the <strong>finger</strong> constantly! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find wild <strong>Weapons &amp; Gadgets</strong> to destroy everything</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Revive yourself, or your friend, by jamming their <strong>Brain</strong> into a <strong>Birthing Nozzle Station</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vandalize</strong> perfectly good walls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cover your friends in <strong>bodily fluids</strong> while berating them in <strong>Proximity Chat!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customize</strong> your slimy henchman. More eyes? Go for it.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Live your fantasies of <strong>streaking</strong> through a Shopping Mall!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3674940/extras/c95117a433ed9805c9fe64a94e143133.avif?t=1777406085\" width=616 height=194 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3674940/extras/08b2b87addd2f8e1bfdf7dba2582635d.avif?t=1777406085\" width=616 height=70 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3674940/extras/9f345d9211e7a97fc62c4125c0304dd9.poster.avif?t=1777406085\" width=616 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3674940/extras/9f345d9211e7a97fc62c4125c0304dd9.webm?t=1777406085\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3674940/extras/9f345d9211e7a97fc62c4125c0304dd9.mp4?t=1777406085\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I'm gonna kick you out of the Garbage Truck onto these stupid little corporate Malls - that's all that's left on this haggard planet after the bazillionaires destroyed everything.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3674940/extras/77ee7db2751950566d7361cfb15ea25d.avif?t=1777406085\" width=616 height=70 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3674940/extras/0b5c497eb036dfa58c0a532ca7660644.poster.avif?t=1777406085\" width=616 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3674940/extras/0b5c497eb036dfa58c0a532ca7660644.webm?t=1777406085\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3674940/extras/0b5c497eb036dfa58c0a532ca7660644.mp4?t=1777406085\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steal everything! Break everything! Cause utter mayhem! I hate this place! Complete my objectives and I'll come pick you up - whether you're in one piece or not.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3674940/extras/e9d4290f8005b041fe8c1ce3ae08a6fb.avif?t=1777406085\" width=616 height=70 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3674940/extras/c9905cd6af9137147aaf489975faf1e9.poster.avif?t=1777406085\" width=616 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3674940/extras/c9905cd6af9137147aaf489975faf1e9.webm?t=1777406085\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3674940/extras/c9905cd6af9137147aaf489975faf1e9.mp4?t=1777406085\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use whatever money you made to buy cool new gadgets and weapons for the next island... I guarantee it'll be more difficult! Don't blow your little brain out with those things, I've seen it happen.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3674940/extras/176ca130f435950c9bb11f7cec406017.avif?t=1777406085\" width=616 height=70 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3674940/extras/7e098b88888d358f7974d3e7b0e97cab.poster.avif?t=1777406085\" width=616 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3674940/extras/7e098b88888d358f7974d3e7b0e97cab.webm?t=1777406085\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3674940/extras/7e098b88888d358f7974d3e7b0e97cab.mp4?t=1777406085\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I’ll give you points for every Crime you commit. And hey, if you're better than your friends, I might give you some Merle Vouchers - good enough to buy some new... What do they call 'em? Cosmetics? That's weird.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3674940/extras/2a1b01cb9589c764c291c825562d0196.avif?t=1777406085\" width=616 height=70 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Active Development at WALLRIDE</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This project is in <strong>active development</strong>. We welcome you to join our community, our Discord and social media to help collaborate with us on everything we have planned for the future! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That means things will change how they look and feel, new features will come and go, and we'll have plenty of beta tests for our community members to enjoy! So grab some friends and come check it out.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><u>Since you somehow snuck in here early… here’s more about the game:</u></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3674940/extras/93fd7608d29f2eabe2f7afd48a0f6201.avif?t=1777406085\" width=616 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do Crimes is a <strong>WALLRIDE-Certified Chaos Playground</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You and up to 3 friends <strong>GO ON A RUN</strong> of crash-landing into Shopping Malls, <strong>SMASHING &amp; GRABBING LOOT</strong>, Avoiding Security, and trying not to get <strong>KILLED</strong> by Gnarly Law Enforcement. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steal everything… <strong>Try to Escape</strong>… then hit the next, m